          "note": "Roman Urdu: Why Encapsulation is important with the bank-account example (PDF 39, printed 35)."
        }
      ],
      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Data ko ghair zaroori pohanch se bachati hai.",
              "Security (hifazat) behtar karti hai.",
              "Code sambhalna aasan banati hai.",
              "Sirf qaboo mein rakhi hui (controlled) tabdeeli ki ijazat deti hai."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Misal (Example):"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Bank account ka sochein:"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Aap ka balance chhupa hua hai."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Aap us tak sirf in ke zariye pohanch sakte hain:"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "deposit() (paise jama karna)",
              "withdraw() (paise nikalna)"
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Aap balance ko seedha nahi badal sakte; yahi encapsulation hai."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Mukhtasar khulasa"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Fawaid: data ki hifazat, behtar security, aasan code, qaboo wali tabdeeli.",
              "Bank account: balance chhupa hai; sirf deposit() aur withdraw() se badalta hai."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
